/*!
  \page eucalyptus_overview Eucalyptus

  Eucalyptus is the characterization tool of the PandA framework.
  It is used to analyze and populate technology-library information that can then be consumed by synthesis and back-end flows.

  This page is intentionally concise: operational details should stay aligned with the currently shipped technology descriptions, scripts, and command-line interface.

*/
